<h3><u>Zinda rakhenge hum Karbala</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>haider ke hami - zinda hai<br />
shabbar ke hami - zinda hai<br />
shabbir ke hami - zinda hai<br />
abbas ke hami - zinda hai<br />
sajjad ke hami - zinda hai<br />
akbar ke hami - zinda hai<br />
asghar ke hami - zinda hai<br />
qasim ke hami - zinda hai</p>

<p>Tujse wada hai ye (shahe karbobala) -2<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain<br />
karbala karbala karbala - ya husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain</p>

<p>apni aawaz me, apne andaaz me<br />
apne anjaam me, apne aghaaz me<br />
hum sadaa.. Husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain<br />
karbala karbala karbala - ya husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain</p>

<p>1. Apni naslo ko paigham de hum yahi<br />
matame shahe dee (qarz hai har ghadi) - 2<br />
maqsade karbala aam karte raho<br />
waqf kardo ghame (shaah me zindagi) - 2<br />
apne paighaam me, apne ehkaam me<br />
apne aaraam me, apne har kaam me<br />
hum sadaa.. Husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain<br />
karbala karbala karbala - ya husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain</p>

<p>2. Surato me takaza ye karta rahe<br />
tum raho na raho (haq to zinda rahe) - 2<br />
saans ruk jae kat jae chahe zaba<br />
khoon behta rahe (aur ye kehta rahe) - 2<br />
apne tatheer me, apni tafseer me<br />
apni tehreer me, apni taqreer me<br />
hum sadaa.. Husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain<br />
karbala karbala karbala - ya husain<br />
zinda rakhenge hum karbala - ya husain</p>

<p>3. Maa ne gutthi me humko pilaya hai kya<br />
karbala karbala (karbala karbala) - 2<br />
bolna yu sikhaya ke bolo zara<br />
karbala karbala (karbala karbala) - 2<br />
apne azhaan me, apne wehdan me<br />
apne eeman me , apne ailaan me</p>

<p>4. zuljanah ho amari alam taziya<br />
ye alaamat hai (mit na jae kahi) - 2<br />
mannati hathkadi aur kalawe jo hai<br />
saari duniya me ye (apni pehchaan hai) - 2<br />
apni akaar me, apni guftaar me<br />
apne eesaar me, apne qirdaar me</p>

<p>5. Nauha khwani ka mansab mila hai jise<br />
uspe wajib hua (bus ye paigham de) - 2<br />
tere lehje me haadi ki darkaar ho<br />
aur chehre pe ho (karb sajjad ke) - 2<br />
apni faryaad me, apni uftaad me<br />
apni har yaad me, apne aulaad me</p>

<p>6. sabke laasho pe shabbir rote rahe<br />
laashe shabbir par (koi ro na saka) - 2<br />
ye sitam dekh kar boli sajjad se<br />
binte khaiber shikan, (saniye sayyada) - 2<br />
apne ailaan me, ghum ke aiwaan me<br />
ghum ke toofan me, jaake zindaan me</p>

<p>7. Jab aseerane ghum shaam jaane lage<br />
chashme sajjad se (ashk behne lage) - 2<br />
bekafan baap ki laash par gir pade<br />
mera wada hai ye (roke kehne lage)- 2<br />
apne aazaar me, rahe purkhaar me<br />
jaake bazaar me, aur darbaar me</p>

<p>8. Kamsino ki judai me asghar ka ghum<br />
aur jawano ke ghum me (ho akbar ka ghum)- 2<br />
baap se koi beti bichad jae gar<br />
hum manaenge (bali sakina ka ghum) - 2<br />
apne pyaro ka ghum, bhool jaenge hum<br />
har jagah har qadam, maula teri qasam</p>

<p>9. jo qalam aur awaaz par qarz hai<br />
qarz wo ho adaa (al madad sayyada) - 2<br />
kaam farhan o mazhar ye karte rahe<br />
qarya qarya sada (al madad sayyada) - 2<br />
maqsade karbala, chhup nahi paega<br />
tujhse wada raha, jaan karke fida</p>

<p>ya husain... yaa... husain</p>
